## Quick Wins (< 1 day each)

| Change | Impact |
|--------|--------|
| Add `list_directory` tool | Unlocks file discovery for agents |
| Increase `search_codebase` `--max-count` from 5→20 | Fewer missed cross-file impacts |
| Increase PR body limit from 1000→3000 chars | Better intent context |
| Increase commit messages from 2→7 | Richer PR narrative |
| Wire `responseSchema` to Gemini API | Eliminates parsing failures |
| Remove unused `allowed_domain` input | Cleaner action config |

